title: Linksjugend Solid
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
card-image: img/LinksjugendSolid.jpg
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; solid_timer += 6;
max-visits: 6
view-if: solid_timer <= 0
#subtitle: subtitle text

= SoLiD

The Linksjugend SoLiD' is our youth organization and one of the main groups responsible for grassroots campaigns and recruitment. 

- @militant: Invest in Solid.
- @same: Keep the Linksjugend as it is.
- @cut_rb: Cut funding for the Linksjugend.
- @easy_discard
- @cancel_advisor_action

@militant
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; solid += 1; beweli_strength += 3; pragmatist_dissent += 5; foreign_moderation -= 0.5; econ_moderation -= 0.5; social_moderation -= 0.5; youth += 3*(1-dissent); spd_relation -= 4; greens_relation -= 2;

We have decided to invest more funds into our youth wing. This gives more energy to our party, but may have the unwanted effect of radicalizing us.

@same

@cut_rb
subtitle: +1 resources
on-arrival: resources += 1; solid -= 1; beweli_strength -= 2; beweli_dissent += 1; youth_linke -= 2; youth_greens += 2;

We have reduced our funding for the Linksjugend.
